{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a self-hosted Qwen architecture on PAI-EAS behind an AI Gateway for per-team quotas, failover and private VPC access."}
{"t":"req","text":"Data stays in Singapore","regions":["ap-southeast-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","alb","ai-gateway","pai-eas","nat","sls","prometheus","ram"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"model-size","text":"Large model needs dedicated GPU instances","alt":"Smaller model on fewer GPUs"}
{"t":"assume","id":"failover-target","text":"Failover to hosted Qwen via Model Studio","alt":"Second PAI-EAS replica only"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"LLM VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Internal users","group":null,"why":"2000 concurrent internal staff calling the LLM."}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"Internal ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Private load balancer exposing the gateway inside the VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"private"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"ai-gateway","label":"AI Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Per-team token quotas, routing and failover policies."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"pai-eas","label":"Qwen LLM service","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Dedicated GPU serving the large Qwen model with autoscaling."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-llm","from":"gateway","to":"llm","label":"primary"}
{"t":"node","id":"model-studio","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio fallback","group":"sg","why":"Hosted Qwen endpoint used when PAI-EAS is overloaded or down."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ms","from":"gateway","to":"model-studio","label":"failover","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Lets PAI-EAS reach Model Studio failover endpoint over the internet."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-llm-nat","from":"llm","to":"nat","label":"egress"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-nat-ms","from":"nat","to":"model-studio","label":"outbound"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding observability: SLS for gateway logs and Prometheus for GPU metrics."}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes AI Gateway and PAI-EAS access logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-logs","from":"gateway","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"metrics","product":"prometheus","label":"Prometheus","group":"sg","why":"Monitors GPU utilization and inference latency."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-llm-metrics","from":"llm","to":"metrics","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"team-count","text":"How many teams need separate token quotas?","options":["Under 10","10 to 50","Over 50"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"gpu-budget","text":"Do you have a preferred GPU budget or instance family?","options":["No preference","A10 instances","V100 instances"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Self-hosted Qwen on PAI-EAS behind AI Gateway with per-team quotas, Model Studio failover, NAT egress and observability in Singapore."}

{"t":"say","text":"我来为您设计一个基于 PAI-EAS 的私有知识库问答系统，向量数据库和模型推理都部署在 VPC 内网。"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","nat","pai-eas","elasticsearch","oss","ai-gateway"]}
{"t":"req","text":"向量数据留在 VPC 内网","regions":["ap-southeast-1"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"内部用户约数百人","alt":"数千并发用户"}
{"t":"assume","id":"model","text":"使用自托管微调 Qwen 模型","alt":"直接调用 Model Studio 托管 API"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"内部用户","group":"internet","why":"通过浏览器访问知识库问答系统的员工"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"云解析 DNS","group":null,"why":"将内部域名解析到 ALB 入口"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"作为内部问答系统的统一入口负载均衡器"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ai-gw","product":"ai-gateway","label":"AI Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"统一路由请求到 RAG 服务，提供限流与鉴权"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ai-gw","from":"alb","to":"ai-gw","label":"API"}
{"t":"node","id":"rag","product":"pai-eas","label":"RAG 服务","group":"vpc","why":"运行检索增强生成逻辑，查询向量库并组装提示词"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ai-gw-rag","from":"ai-gw","to":"rag","label":"private endpoint"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"pai-eas","label":"Qwen LLM 推理","group":"vpc","why":"部署自有 Qwen 模型权重，提供专属 GPU 推理能力"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rag-llm","from":"rag","to":"llm","label":"推理请求"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector-db","product":"elasticsearch","label":"Elasticsearch 向量库","group":"vpc","why":"存储文档向量嵌入，支持混合检索，数据完全在内网"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rag-vector","from":"rag","to":"vector-db","label":"向量检索"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT 网关","group":"vpc","why":"为 PAI-EAS 节点提供出站公网访问能力"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rag-nat","from":"rag","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"OSS 文档存储","group":"sg","why":"存放原始内部文档及向量化处理后的数据文件"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rag-docs","from":"rag","to":"docs","label":"读取文档","kind":"data"}
{"t":"ask","id":"doc-format","text":"您的内部文档主要是什么格式？这会影响文档解析组件的选择。","options":["PDF / Word","Markdown / HTML","混合型"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"auth-method","text":"内部用户访问该系统需要哪种身份验证方式？","options":["企业 SSO (IDaaS)","RAM 角色","无需认证 (纯内网)"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"基于 PAI-EAS 的私有 RAG 架构：ALB 接入，AI Gateway 路由，RAG 服务与 Qwen LLM 双 EAS 节点，Elasticsearch 向量库全内网部署。"}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a multi-node training cluster in Frankfurt with fast parallel storage, then serve the fine-tuned 30B model."}
{"t":"req","text":"Training data must stay in Frankfurt","regions":["eu-central-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["oss","cpfs","pai-dlc","pai-eas","nat","sls","acr"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"training-type","text":"Fine-tuning or SFT of an existing 30B base model","alt":"Full pre-training from scratch"}
{"t":"assume","id":"access","text":"Internal team access only","alt":"Public API endpoint"}
{"t":"group","id":"frankfurt","kind":"region","label":"Frankfurt (eu-central-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Training VPC","parent":"frankfurt"}
{"t":"node","id":"oss","product":"oss","label":"Training data and checkpoints","group":"frankfurt","why":"Stores datasets and model weights; data stays in Frankfurt."}
{"t":"node","id":"cpfs","product":"cpfs","label":"Parallel file storage","group":"vpc","why":"High-throughput shared filesystem for multi-GPU training jobs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-oss-cpfs","from":"oss","to":"cpfs","label":"data sync","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"pai-dlc","product":"pai-dlc","label":"Distributed training jobs","group":"vpc","why":"Runs multi-node 30B model training across GPUs using CPFS."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cpfs-pai-dlc","from":"cpfs","to":"pai-dlc","label":"read/write","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-pai-dlc-oss","from":"pai-dlc","to":"oss","label":"checkpoints","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"pai-eas","product":"pai-eas","label":"Model serving endpoint","group":"vpc","why":"Serves the trained 30B model online with autoscaling."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-pai-dlc-pai-eas","from":"pai-dlc","to":"pai-eas","label":"deploy","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-pai-eas-oss","from":"pai-eas","to":"oss","label":"load weights","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Outbound internet for pulling images and dependencies securely."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-pai-dlc-nat","from":"pai-dlc","to":"nat","label":"egress","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"acr","product":"acr","label":"Container Registry","group":"frankfurt","why":"Stores custom training and serving container images locally."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-acr-pai-dlc","from":"acr","to":"pai-dlc","label":"pull image","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"sls","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":"frankfurt","why":"Centralizes training logs and metrics in Frankfurt."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-pai-dlc-sls","from":"pai-dlc","to":"sls","label":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-pai-eas-sls","from":"pai-eas","to":"sls","label":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"say","text":"Lingjun provides bare-metal GPU clusters with RDMA networking, but access is allowlisted through your account manager."}
{"t":"ask","id":"gpu-access","text":"Do you already have Lingjun allowlist access via your account manager for large-scale training?","options":["Yes, we have access","No, use public PAI-DLC GPUs","Not sure yet"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"model-origin","text":"Is this a Qwen model you want to fine-tune, or another open-weight 30B model?","options":["Qwen model","Other open-weight model","Custom architecture"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Frankfurt-based 30B model training on PAI-DLC with CPFS parallel storage, saving to OSS, and serving via PAI-EAS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a serverless coding agent in Singapore using AgentRun with isolated sandboxes, no Kubernetes."}
{"t":"req","text":"No Kubernetes","avoid":["kubernetes"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","agentrun","agent-sandbox","model-studio","tablestore","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"access","text":"Internal team access only","alt":"Public-facing API"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Developers","group":"internet","why":"Team members interacting with the coding agent."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"agentrun","product":"agentrun","label":"Coding agent runtime","group":"sg","why":"Serverless code-first agent hosting without Kubernetes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-agentrun","from":"users","to":"agentrun","label":"prompts"}
{"t":"node","id":"sandbox","product":"agent-sandbox","label":"Isolated sandbox","group":"sg","why":"Runs agent-written code in secure isolation."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentrun-sandbox","from":"agentrun","to":"sandbox","label":"execute"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Provides Qwen models for agent reasoning and code generation."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentrun-llm","from":"agentrun","to":"llm","label":"inference"}
{"t":"node","id":"memory","product":"tablestore","label":"Agent memory","group":"sg","why":"Stores conversation history and agent state at scale."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentrun-memory","from":"agentrun","to":"memory","label":"state"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects agent traces and sandbox execution logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentrun-logs","from":"agentrun","to":"logs","kind":"control","label":"traces"}
{"t":"ask","id":"tools","text":"Should the agent call external tools or APIs beyond the sandbox?","options":["Yes, needs NAT gateway","No, sandbox only"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"team-size","text":"How many developers will use this agent concurrently?","options":["Under 10","10 to 50","Over 50"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless coding agent on AgentRun in Singapore with isolated sandboxes, Model Studio, Tablestore memory and SLS logging—no Kubernetes."}

{"t":"say","text":"PAI-LangStudio is not in the catalog. I'll draw a document Q&A agent using AgentCore, Model Studio and Milvus instead."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","agentcore","model-studio","milvus","oss","ecs"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore region","alt":"Another supported region"}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Internal team use","alt":"Public-facing app"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Team members","group":"internet","why":"People asking questions about documents."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Agent VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"agentcore","product":"agentcore","label":"AgentCore","group":"vpc","why":"Runs the Q&A agent with skills and MCP tools."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-agentcore","from":"users","to":"agentcore","label":"chat"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Hosted Qwen model for answering questions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-llm","from":"agentcore","to":"llm","label":"LLM calls"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector-db","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus","group":"vpc","why":"Vector store for document embeddings used in RAG."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-vector","from":"agentcore","to":"vector-db","label":"RAG search"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Document storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores source documents for ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-docs","from":"agentcore","to":"docs","label":"read docs"}
{"t":"node","id":"ingest","product":"ecs","label":"Ingestion worker","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Chunks documents and writes embeddings to Milvus."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ingest-docs","from":"ingest","to":"docs","label":"fetch"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ingest-vector","from":"ingest","to":"vector-db","label":"embed"}
{"t":"ask","id":"doc-format","text":"What format are your source documents?","options":["PDF","Word/DOCX","HTML/web pages","Mixed formats"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"access-channel","text":"How should the team reach the agent?","options":["Web chat UI","DingTalk integration","API only"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Document Q&A agent built on AgentCore, Model Studio for LLM, Milvus for vector search and OSS for document storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw an agentic RL post-training architecture in Singapore using PAI-DLC for training and Agent Sandbox for thousands of rollouts."}
{"t":"say","text":"Note: this is a custom design with no official Alibaba Cloud reference for agentic RL with sandboxes. The nearest documented pattern is the ACK plus VeRL walkthrough."}
{"t":"plan","products":["pai-dlc","agent-sandbox","oss","model-studio","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"training-scale","text":"Multi-node GPU training on public GPUs","alt":"Single-node fine-tuning"}
{"t":"assume","id":"sandbox-api","text":"Agent Sandbox via E2B-compatible API","alt":"ACS Agent Sandbox on Kubernetes"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"trainer","product":"pai-dlc","label":"RL trainer","group":"sg","why":"Runs distributed RL training jobs across GPU nodes."}
{"t":"node","id":"sandboxes","product":"agent-sandbox","label":"Rollout sandboxes","group":"sg","why":"Spawns thousands of short-lived isolated environments for rollouts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-trainer-sandboxes","from":"trainer","to":"sandboxes","label":"rollouts","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"models","product":"oss","label":"Checkpoints and data","group":"sg","why":"Stores model weights, datasets and rollout results."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-trainer-models","from":"trainer","to":"models","label":"read/write","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sandboxes-models","from":"sandboxes","to":"models","label":"artifacts","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Hosted Qwen models","group":"sg","why":"Serves LLM inference for agent actions during rollouts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sandboxes-llm","from":"sandboxes","to":"llm","label":"inference","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Training logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects RL metrics, traces and sandbox logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-trainer-logs","from":"trainer","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sandboxes-logs","from":"sandboxes","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"k8s-preference","text":"Do you already run ACK or ACS and prefer pod-based sandboxes instead of the managed Agent Sandbox API?","options":["Keep Agent Sandbox API","Use ACS Agent Sandbox pods"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"model-choice","text":"Will rollouts call hosted Qwen models or your own model served on PAI-EAS?","options":["Hosted Qwen (Model Studio)","Self-hosted on PAI-EAS"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Agentic RL post-training in Singapore with PAI-DLC orchestrating thousands of Agent Sandbox rollouts, OSS for checkpoints and Model Studio for inference."}

{"t":"say","text":"For inference in Singapore, A10, T4, V100 and P100 GPUs are generally available. Newer cards need sales confirmation."}
{"t":"rec","product":"pai-eas","fit":"primary","why":"Managed online serving for your own models on dedicated GPU instances in Singapore."}
{"t":"rec","product":"egs","fit":"complement","why":"GPU-accelerated ECS instances (A10, T4, V100, P100) for custom inference workloads."}
{"t":"done","summary":"A10, T4, V100 and P100 GPUs are generally available in Singapore for inference; newer cards require sales confirmation."}

{"t":"say","text":"ACS Agent Sandbox has no GPUs, so fine-tuning Qwen3-8B must run on PAI DLC instead. I'll draw that setup."}
{"t":"plan","products":["pai-dlc","oss","pai-eas","model-studio"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"method","text":"Full or LoRA fine-tuning with custom code or weights","alt":"Light SFT of hosted Qwen via Model Studio"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"training","product":"pai-dlc","label":"Fine-tune Qwen3-8B","group":"sg","why":"Runs distributed GPU training jobs for model fine-tuning."}
{"t":"node","id":"storage","product":"oss","label":"Datasets and checkpoints","group":"sg","why":"Stores training data, model weights and output checkpoints."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-storage","from":"training","to":"storage","label":"read/write","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"serving","product":"pai-eas","label":"Serve fine-tuned model","group":"sg","why":"Deploys the tuned Qwen3-8B as an online inference endpoint."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-storage-serving","from":"storage","to":"serving","label":"load weights","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-serving","from":"training","to":"serving","label":"deploy","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"sandbox-goal","text":"Did you need agent sandboxes to run code generated by the fine-tuned model?","options":["Yes, add agent sandboxes","No, just the model"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Qwen3-8B fine-tuning uses PAI DLC on GPUs with OSS storage, then deploys to PAI EAS; ACS Agent Sandbox has no GPUs."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a fast, secure furniture shop for Southeast Asia using ESA at the edge, ECS web servers, Tair cache and RDS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 10k monthly visitors","alt":"Over 100k monthly visitors"}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing storefront","alt":"Invite-only catalog"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers across SEA","group":"internet","why":"Customers browsing handmade furniture from Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the shop domain to ESA edge nodes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches product images and pages close to SEA shoppers."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Shop VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes traffic to web servers across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects checkout and forms from bots and attacks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Web servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Hosts the furniture catalog and order logic."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Adds servers during sales or promotions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair, orders to RDS, and product photos live in OSS served by ESA."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Keeps carts and sessions fast across zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores orders and inventory with HA standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Product photos","group":"sg","why":"Stores high-res furniture images ESA delivers."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects access logs and errors for monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"payment","text":"How will customers pay?","options":["Credit card gateway","Bank transfer only","Cash on delivery"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"platform","text":"Which e-commerce platform do you plan to use?","options":["Custom built","WordPress / WooCommerce","Shopify headless"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Two-zone furniture shop behind ESA, ALB with WAF, ECS with Auto Scaling, Tair cache, RDS and OSS for images."}

{"t":"say","text":"I can help you plan your cloud migration. To point you to the right architecture, I need a few details."}
{"t":"ask","id":"current-state","text":"Where are your workloads running today?","options":["On-premises data center","Another cloud provider","No existing infrastructure"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"workload-type","text":"What type of workload are you moving first?","options":["Web application or API","Data analytics or AI","Entire company infrastructure"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Waiting for details about your current environment and workload to design your migration path."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw an internal HR leave portal in Singapore, reachable only from your company network via VPN Gateway."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","onprem-dc","vpn-gateway","vpc","alb","sae","rds","sls"]}
{"t":"req","text":"Only employees on the company network should reach it"}
{"t":"assume","id":"new-build","text":"New build with no existing cloud resources","alt":"Existing VPC and infrastructure"}
{"t":"group","id":"office","kind":"onprem","label":"Company network","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"office","why":"400 staff submitting leave requests from the office."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"HR VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"vpn","product":"vpn-gateway","label":"VPN Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Encrypted tunnel so only the company network reaches the VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-vpn","from":"users","to":"vpn","label":"IPsec"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"Internal ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Private load balancer distributing traffic across zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-vpn-alb","from":"vpn","to":"alb"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"sae","label":"HR portal app","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Serverless container host for the leave request portal."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Leave requests DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores leave records with a standby in the second zone."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects portal access and application logs."}
